# Freelancer API Credentials
# Get your free API credentials at: https://developers.freelancer.com/
# 1. Go to https://developers.freelancer.com/
# 2. Sign in with your Freelancer account
# 3. Create a new app to get your Client ID
# 4. Generate an API key from your app settings

FREELANCER_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id_here
FREELANCER_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Note: The Freelancer API works without authentication for basic read operations,
# but adding credentials gives you higher rate limits and access to more features.
